## ⚡ Overview

**PS5 Next-Gen Emulator** is an open-source, low-overhead virtualization and syscall translation environment designed to run PlayStation 5 titles natively on modern x86-64 PC hardware. This specialized branch focuses on shader pipeline optimization, custom I/O decompression, and memory management tailored for **Grand Theft Auto VI**.

## 🔥 Key Features

* **🚀 Custom Kraken Decompression:** Hardware-accelerated asset streaming mimicking the PS5 custom I/O controller via DirectStorage / Vulkan.
* **🎨 RDNA 2 to Vulkan / DX12 Translation:** Real-time SPIR-V shader recompilation with asynchronous pipeline caching to eliminate stuttering.
* **🧠 Unified Memory Emulation:** Dynamic RAM/VRAM allocation bridge replicating the 16GB GDDR6 unified memory architecture.
* **🎮 DualSense Native Support:** Full adaptive triggers and haptic feedback passthrough over USB and Bluetooth.
* **⚡ Unlocked Framerates:** Built-in frame-pacing patches supporting 60+ FPS and ultrawide resolutions (21:9 / 32:9).

---

## 💻 System Requirements

| Component | Minimum | Recommended (4K / 60 FPS) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **OS** | Windows 10 (22H2) / Ubuntu 22.04 | Windows 11 (24H2) / Arch Linux |
| **CPU** | AMD Ryzen 5 5600X / Intel Core i5-12600K (AVX2) | AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D / Intel Core i7-14700K |
| **GPU** | NVIDIA RTX 3060 / AMD RX 6700 XT (Vulkan 1.3) | NVIDIA RTX 4080 / AMD RX 7900 XTX |
| **RAM** | 16 GB DDR4 | 32 GB DDR5 |
| **Storage** | NVMe SSD (PCIe Gen 3) | NVMe SSD (PCIe Gen 4, 7000+ MB/s) |

---

## 🛠️ Quick Start

1. **Clone the repository:**
   ```bash
   git clone --recursive https://github.com
   cd PS5-NextGen-Emu-GTA6-Edition
   ```
2. **Place your dumped firmware & keys:**
   Put your legally obtained PS5 system modules into the `/firmware/` directory.
3. **Launch the Runtime:**
   ```bash
   ./ps5-emu-launcher --vulkan --async-shaders --game "path/to/game_eboot.bin"
   ```

